<odoo>
 <record id="path_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.list</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list><field name="name"/><field name="state"/><field name="bound_at"/><field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company"/></list></field></record>
 <record id="path_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.form</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form string="Édition de parcours"><header><button name="action_publish" type="object" string="Publier le parcours" class="btn-primary" invisible="state != 'draft'"/><button name="action_register" type="object" string="Autoriser un bénéficiaire" groups="training_elearning.group_elearning_manager" invisible="state != 'published'"/><field name="state" widget="statusbar"/></header><sheet><group><field name="name" readonly="bound_at"/><field name="company_id" readonly="id" groups="base.group_multi_company"/><field name="introduction" readonly="bound_at"/><field name="bound_at"/></group><field name="line_ids" readonly="bound_at"><list editable="bottom"><field name="sequence" widget="handle"/><field name="course_id" domain="[('training_course_id','!=',False),('learning_state','=','published'),('learning_company_id','=',parent.company_id)]" options="{'no_create':True}"/><field name="required"/></list></field><p>Le parcours référence des éditions précises de cours natifs, avec leurs prérequis. Sa progression agrège leurs acquis sans créer une seconde progression. Une composition engagée exige une nouvelle édition pour changer les obligations.</p></sheet></form></field></record>
 <record id="path_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Parcours autonomes</field><field name="res_model">training.elearning.path</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field></record>
 <menuitem id="learning_paths" name="Parcours autonomes" parent="learning_root" action="path_action" groups="training_elearning.group_elearning_author" sequence="20"/>
 <record id="path_registration_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.registration.list</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path.registration</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list create="0" delete="0"><field name="path_id"/><field name="partner_id"/><field name="user_id"/><field name="registered_at"/></list></field></record>
 <record id="path_registration_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.registration.form</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path.registration</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form create="0" delete="0"><sheet><group><field name="path_id"/><field name="partner_id"/><field name="user_id"/><field name="registered_at"/></group><field name="activation_ids"><list create="0" delete="0"><field name="activated_at"/><field name="starts_until"/><field name="access_months"/><field name="start_paused"/></list></field></sheet></form></field></record>
 <record id="path_activation_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.activation.list</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path.activation</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list create="0" delete="0"><field name="registration_id"/><field name="activated_at"/><field name="starts_until"/><field name="access_months"/><field name="start_paused"/></list></field></record>
 <record id="path_activation_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.activation.form</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path.activation</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form create="0" delete="0"><header><button name="action_adjust" type="object" string="Ajuster les démarrages avec motif"/></header><sheet><group><field name="registration_id"/><field name="activated_at"/><field name="starts_until"/><field name="access_months"/><field name="reason"/><field name="start_paused"/></group><field name="item_ids"><list create="0" delete="0"><field name="course_id"/><field name="membership_id"/><field name="activated_at"/><field name="access_started_at"/><field name="access_ends_at"/><field name="blocked_at"/><field name="block_reason"/></list></field><p>La fenêtre de démarrage ne constitue pas un droit d’accès aux contenus. Chaque cours démarré produit une adhésion native et sa durée complète. Une pause ne suspend pas les accès déjà ouverts et ne repousse aucune date. Les incidents et retards demandent une décision tracée.</p></sheet></form></field></record>
 <record id="path_activation_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Activations de parcours</field><field name="res_model">training.elearning.path.activation</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field></record>
 <menuitem id="learning_path_activations" name="Activations de parcours" parent="learning_root" action="path_activation_action" groups="training_elearning.group_elearning_manager" sequence="35"/>
 <record id="path_activate_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.activate</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path.activate</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form string="Autorisation explicite de parcours"><group><field name="path_id"/><field name="partner_id"/><field name="course_ids" widget="many2many_tags" domain="[('training_course_id','!=',False)]" options="{'no_create':True}"/><field name="access_months"/><field name="start_months"/><field name="reason"/></group><p>Cette autorisation manuelle est distincte d’une vente. Elle ouvre les cours sélectionnés dès leurs prérequis satisfaits, dans la fenêtre prévue. Les acquis de la même édition restent réutilisés ; les autres cours ne sont pas implicitement financés.</p><footer><button name="action_activate" type="object" string="Autoriser et démarrer les cours éligibles" class="btn-primary"/><button special="cancel" string="Annuler"/></footer></form></field></record>
 <record id="path_adjust_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.adjust</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path.adjust</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form string="Ajustement des démarrages"><group><field name="activation_id"/><field name="starts_until"/><field name="paused"/><field name="reason"/></group><p>Expliquer notamment un retard de correction. Les cours déjà démarrés gardent leurs dates ; un renouvellement personnel de cours ne modifie pas cette limite.</p><footer><button name="action_apply" type="object" string="Enregistrer et vérifier les cours éligibles" class="btn-primary"/><button special="cancel" string="Annuler"/></footer></form></field></record>
 <record id="path_notice_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">learning.path.notice.list</field><field name="model">training.elearning.path.notice</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list create="0" delete="0"><field name="activation_id"/><field name="item_id"/><field name="state"/><field name="sent_at"/><button name="action_retry" type="object" string="Relancer après résolution" invisible="state != 'exception'"/></list></field></record>
 <record id="path_notice_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Notifications de parcours</field><field name="res_model">training.elearning.path.notice</field><field name="view_mode">list</field></record>
 <menuitem id="learning_path_notices" name="Notifications de parcours" parent="learning_root" action="path_notice_action" groups="training_elearning.group_elearning_manager" sequence="48"/>
</odoo>
